📊 Analysis of Poverty Levels in West Java, 2022
Overview:
This project presents a descriptive statistical analysis of poverty levels across regencies and cities in West Java Province in 2022 using official data published by Statistics Indonesia (BPS). The analysis aims to identify regions with the highest and lowest poverty rates, examine regional disparities, and provide insights into socioeconomic conditions throughout the province.
The study applies descriptive statistical techniques and data visualization to better understand poverty distribution across West Java and highlight differences among local governments.

Objectives:
Analyze poverty levels across regencies and cities in West Java.
Identify regions with the highest and lowest poverty rates.
Calculate the average poverty rate in West Java.
Compare poverty conditions among regions.
Visualize poverty data using charts and rankings.
Interpret statistical findings for socioeconomic analysis.

